{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e892fd3d-7312-5761-953c-46c0d0a799cb", "source_ordinal": 2582, "reading_ordinal": 1471, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "因小失大", "published_at": "2022-10-02T09:47:07+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/555181367/answer/2698173694"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "Staff不宜轻易享用客人的餐食、用具，这是一个忌讳，很容易惹纠纷。这是个专业性要求，一种行规，没什么好说的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 55}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "具体到这个案例本身，你是情有可原，但是作为专业人士，你不应该轻易放松自己的原则。正所谓小心行得万年船。", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 107}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "今天觉得这里不妨去去，那里也能冲冲，这还行个啥万年船？", "char_start": 108, "char_end": 135}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这和这事具体的是非没啥关系，既然是自己犯了行规，这后果也并没有什么了不起的，给自己一个教训就好了。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "至于这一对新人，ta们之间内部权力如何划分，这是人家的家事，外人没必要关心，也没余地置喙，最多问一句“这是不是你们的最终一致决定”而已。", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 255}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但从这对新人自身的角度来说，这其实是因小失大了。", "char_start": 256, "char_end": 280}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "比起在婚礼上就留下这么一个“丈夫说话不值2000块”的祸根，省两千块属于微不足道的收益。", "char_start": 281, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "省下的2000块没几天就吃掉了。", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "但是留下的“没有基本的尊重”的嫌隙可能在一生中被反复提起，耿耿于怀，产生远大于2000块的成本。", "char_start": 343, "char_end": 391}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这对个人幸福的破坏，岂是2000块能救得回来的？", "char_start": 392, "char_end": 416}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "从这个角度上讲，这是个错误选择。", "char_start": 417, "char_end": 433}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "做事还是要学会算账。", "char_start": 434, "char_end": 444}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0229"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：宁波一司仪主持完婚礼上桌吃饭被扣 2000 多元，这一做法是否合理？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“因小失大”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“Staff不宜轻易享用客人的餐食、用具，这是一个忌讳，很容易惹纠纷。这是个专业性要求，一种行规，没什么好说的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "Staff不宜轻易享用客人的餐食、用具，这是一个忌讳，很容易惹纠纷。这是个专业性要求，一种行规，没什么好说的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 55, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d6d1e180-0193-53b2-a5ac-4df3d4481a80", "source_ordinal": 2581, "reading_ordinal": 1472, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "高端人才", "published_at": "2022-10-02T11:59:02+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/550091305/answer/2698329657"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这跟国家、制度没什么关系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "“高端人才”需要高端岗位。有高端岗位自然就会留下甚至产生高端人才。", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你有资本和市场拍3D动画片，自然就会产生技术导演的职位，拍了几部，自然就会产生“经验丰富的技术导演”。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 99}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你有了实力养航母，自然就会产生航母舰长的职位，舰长当几年，自然就会产生“经验丰富的航母舰长”。", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 147}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你有一百八十个师，你就会有青史留名的上将和元帅。", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 172}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你有王牌战斗机，自然会有王牌飞行员。", "char_start": 173, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "稀缺的其实从来就不是凤凰，这会从草窝里不断地孵化出来。就算没凤凰，也会从山鸡里突变出来，真正稀缺的是梧桐树。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "其实，宇宙里稀缺的不是人类，而是地球。", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 266}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这事没有任何奇妙之处，跟“制度”更是近乎毫无关系。那些“任由自由发挥”、“学术自主权”、“对人才的尊重”，其实是和岗位性质、职责需求绑定的，而不是和制度绑定的。有了必须完成的任务，这个任务自然会产生附带这些条件的岗位。", "char_start": 268, "char_end": 377}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "只有制度自己去适应客观需要，客观需要给这些人自主权，制度自己去想办法写条款、走程序、补手续。", "char_start": 378, "char_end": 424}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "需求才是硬的，制度是软的。", "char_start": 425, "char_end": 438}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "需求不满足，你自己就卡死在半道上前进不了了。不前进，你迟早是死路一条。就是这么朴素。", "char_start": 439, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "认为一个高速发展了40年，存续了四千年的文明不清楚这个道理，满足不了这个要求，这是一种何等傲慢的愚蠢？", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 533}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "中国过去几十年是在追赶，主要需求是模仿和复制。", "char_start": 535, "char_end": 558}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "未来几十年是要争先、领导。", "char_start": 559, "char_end": 572}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "时代课题改变了、社会条件变迁了，过去几十年里呈现的“规律”转眼就会一扫而空。", "char_start": 573, "char_end": 611}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "未来的十到二十年，中国很自然地要开始成为文化霸主和新技术霸主，整个经济模式、文化模式都会有转变。很多美国现在自认为独有的模式，都会在中国出现对等的竞争者。", "char_start": 612, "char_end": 689}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "很多对中国的断言，都会被轻松地打破，以至于在二十年后会显得荒唐可笑。", "char_start": 690, "char_end": 724}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "而这只是朴素的历史规律对人类自己屡教不改的种族主义狂妄的一次平平无奇的再教育。", "char_start": 725, "char_end": 764}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "在这方面，上帝从来不会吝惜耳光。", "char_start": 765, "char_end": 781}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0229"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么我国留不住高端人才？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“高端人才”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这跟国家、制度没什么关系。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这跟国家、制度没什么关系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "99fc04c4-6621-5bc7-a7cf-901faec249ae", "source_ordinal": 2580, "reading_ordinal": 1473, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "改编", "published_at": "2022-10-02T14:31:53+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/556937582/answer/2698493347"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么叫“改编”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "改编了，名字也不是你了、情节也不是你了，这事跟你还有什么实在的关系？", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这个意思是世界上不可能发生改编后的剧情，还是说发生了改编后的那种剧情仍然不能允许女生跳车？", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "还是说要因为你自己觉得不爽，就把“改编”这个艺术手法从此废除？", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你回答一下，你是在主张哪一种诉求？", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 139}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "解释一下，你想要这个世界为你发生上述哪一种改变？", "char_start": 140, "char_end": 164}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "自己掂量一下，你有哪些重大的贡献，使得这个社会理应为你改变它这些运行了不知几百、上千年的基本运行规则？", "char_start": 165, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你不爽，没你想的那么重要。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 230}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "也别觉得叫得大声，就以为“同志”很多。", "char_start": 232, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "行不通的东西，喊得再大声，也一样行不通。你那些同志，别说攒到一亿，就算攒到二十亿、八十亿，也改不了圆周率，扭不动抛物线。", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 312}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "随你多“团结”、多“愤怒”，也只会被市场规律、社会规律一鼓而歼。", "char_start": 313, "char_end": 345}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "其实来来回回都是同一群没有良知、极端自私的人在吃你们的流量红利，ta们只管要自己的流量，哪管你找不找得到女朋友，将来在哪吃饭？", "char_start": 347, "char_end": 410}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "让我把这话说透一点——你去归罪于恐慌跳车的女性，会大大提高你找不到女朋友或者与现任分手的概率。", "char_start": 412, "char_end": 459}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你把道理说破天，这个概率也不会改变。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你在这件事上这么干，自然在别的事上也多半很“努力”。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 505}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "中国的制度适不适合历史发展规律有什么要紧，不适合你的需求，那就是错的，是吗？那就要为你改了，对吗？", "char_start": 506, "char_end": 555}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "女性有什么诉求有什么关系，对你不方便，那就是错的，应该为你放弃，是吗？", "char_start": 556, "char_end": 591}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "只要你团结到够多的人，你就可以让世界围绕你的意志运转，就是这么个“革命原理”，对吗？", "char_start": 592, "char_end": 634}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你管这叫“理想主义”，是吗？", "char_start": 635, "char_end": 649}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你这是彻底的本末倒置。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 662}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "是你符合社会规律，你才会团结得起足够多的人，而不是你团结得起足够多的人，你就可以撰写社会规律。", "char_start": 664, "char_end": 711}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "反对你们这些逻辑的，是基于一般原则的社会契约的规律——你要搞一个“司机随便改道但乘客不得恐慌”的企业，你可以试试，可以写在你的企业章程里，上市搏一搏看。", "char_start": 712, "char_end": 788}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "否则只是叫，没有一分钱用，而且会让人打心底里生出鄙视。", "char_start": 789, "char_end": 816}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你不爽，不表示你是对的。你是错的，你不爽，你跳，你只会浪费自己的生命。", "char_start": 818, "char_end": 853}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你不相信，不表示你拒绝相信的就是假的。到最后只能是你自己抛弃你自己的不相信，否则你就卡死在你自己幻想的异次元里，被各种自相矛盾的私人定律轮番殴打。", "char_start": 854, "char_end": 927}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "真当这个世界是你们这些妄图“靠抱怨改变世界”的人话事吗？", "char_start": 928, "char_end": 956}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "凡事要讲道理，少讲情绪。", "char_start": 958, "char_end": 970}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "越讲情绪，人越轻贱，别人很自然而然的要自动把你的声音当噪音过滤掉。", "char_start": 971, "char_end": 1004}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "因为这些哭闹的确只是噪音。", "char_start": 1005, "char_end": 1018}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 37}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0229"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：《底线》改编货拉拉案，给司机增添「酒妆、买药」等不符合实际的行为，货拉拉案司机要求停播是否合情理？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“改编”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么叫“改编”？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么叫“改编”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "827b070f-d63e-5999-98f3-0fe0d98c656e", "source_ordinal": 2579, "reading_ordinal": 1474, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "吏治中兴", "published_at": "2022-10-02T19:47:43+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/554047911/answer/2698828917"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "除了少数职位，美国的公务员岗位一般是没人愿意干而招人困难的状态。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一旦一个职位处在这样一个状态，你就很难对在职者提出什么严格的工作要求了。", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "“再要求就没人干了”，不管操作规程写得多严密，遇上这一条铁门槛就没法办。", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 106}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而以美国政府的体量和体制，如果把基层公务员的待遇提高到优秀人才会竞相加入的地步，恐怕联邦预算会冲破天际。", "char_start": 107, "char_end": 159}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "吏治难，就难在这里——效率令人失望，而税收已经无可再加。", "char_start": 160, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "要改善税金的效率，势必涉及到极深的利益纠葛，甚至可能引发分裂和内战。仅仅这个过程中不可避免的动荡，就会在如此脆弱的执政效率下演变成难以预料后果的重大危机。", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 266}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "于是只能“多一事不如少一事”“徐图将来”。", "char_start": 267, "char_end": 288}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这中间如果有变数，往往需要把商鞅、张居正、王安石式的人物当耗材一样献祭。", "char_start": 289, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "需要这类政治强人不惜冒身败名裂的风险，去挑战既有利益秩序，才能真的续上一口气。", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 365}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "至少这是中国的历史路线。", "char_start": 366, "char_end": 378}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这对美国还是个第一次面对的问题，不清楚美国会走什么路线回答历史的考问。", "char_start": 379, "char_end": 414}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0229"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：在美国，要是公务员在岗位上敷衍塞责、尸位素餐，能治得了吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“吏治中兴”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“除了少数职位，美国的公务员岗位一般是没人愿意干而招人困难的状态。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "除了少数职位，美国的公务员岗位一般是没人愿意干而招人困难的状态。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "bb8dfbb1-3ace-5657-95b1-2616f792f8aa", "source_ordinal": 2578, "reading_ordinal": 1475, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "火候问题", "published_at": "2022-10-02T23:26:29+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/522991739/answer/2699084848"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "欧洲的“政治家”，要等到民心可用的时候才会露头。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "现在民心自己还迷茫着，贸然露头会被重点清除，所以要装糊涂，扮透明。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你光看见一群亲美的在跳，在帮着指鹿为马。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你没看到有一些二线人物现在默不作声，仿佛事不关己。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 105}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "ta们大部分处在一个“现在看不清形势，也没打算去靠个人智慧去下赌注，抢头啖汤”的状态。", "char_start": 106, "char_end": 149}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "ta们在等，看到底是美国的谎言取胜，还是失业、贫穷和严寒取胜，看到底哪个因素会主导选民的倾向。", "char_start": 150, "char_end": 197}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "大家辛苦几十年，爬到现在的位置不容易，火候要看老、看实，要等尘埃落定，风险小到值得开始抢位再说，不要急着表态。", "char_start": 198, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "急着表态，就是提前押宝了。押对了，也可能因为开奖太迟而坚持不到领奖。", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 288}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "只有新生代那些没有包袱，打算一举出位的，以及本来的立场就无法选择，不如一铺撑到底的，才会索性现在就跳出来下注“我们的政府是最愚蠢的政府”。", "char_start": 289, "char_end": 358}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "现在的关键还是看危机是否真的会发生，什么时候开始发生。", "char_start": 359, "char_end": 386}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这群人只会比真正的雪崩早五分钟跳出来当预言家和救世主，这才是职业投机者的风范。", "char_start": 387, "char_end": 426}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "换言之，现在对美国真正压力大的，不是有没有人给ta帮腔——那总是不缺的，总有人已经铁链绑死，想跳船也没机会了，", "char_start": 427, "char_end": 482}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "而是有多少人现在令人玩味的保持沉默。", "char_start": 483, "char_end": 501}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "现在不吭声的，假装“我还没想好”的，“我还要了解一下情况”的，“让小张先说”的，“我腿疼要住院”的，其实就是有潜在想法，想在潮流逆转时多少赶个早集的。", "char_start": 502, "char_end": 577}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但这是阳谋，美国再霸道，也不能不允许人腿疼住院吧？", "char_start": 578, "char_end": 603}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "如果统计游行的民众多到了可能影响选情局面了，到了政治正确的中心议题发生切变了，到时候再看这帮人会说啥。", "char_start": 604, "char_end": 655}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "那时候你才知道有多少人早已人间清醒。", "char_start": 656, "char_end": 674}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "连“反抗军领袖”的生态位都会有人抢。", "char_start": 675, "char_end": 693}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "慢慢等，到底是“欧洲将被去工业化”是真，还是“都只是危言耸听的敌方宣传”是真；到底是“民不聊生”是真，还是“无关痛痒”是真，最后还是要事实说话。", "char_start": 694, "char_end": 766}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "到底是怎样，谁说了也不算，什么理论计算都只是猜测。", "char_start": 767, "char_end": 792}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "最后还是要事实说话。", "char_start": 793, "char_end": 803}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "但不要担心事实说了话，能纯靠“宣传”盖住。", "char_start": 804, "char_end": 825}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "没有轻视西媒霸权的意思，只是历史对此早有定论。", "char_start": 826, "char_end": 849}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "早在史前时代，人类社会普遍真实的相信自己的统治者们是真神。", "char_start": 850, "char_end": 879}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "那不是什么“赌咒发誓保证相信”的相信，而是真的被君主发诅咒就会被吓死的相信。", "char_start": 880, "char_end": 918}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "其笃信的程度，远远超过现在的媒体洗脑所能达到的强度。", "char_start": 919, "char_end": 945}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "如果“因为你们惹得神王不高兴所以今年没收成”就足以解决没饭吃的问题，我们现在应该还在茅草屋里祈求明天没人触怒神木林里的至尊。", "char_start": 946, "char_end": 1008}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你们谁在住茅草屋？", "char_start": 1009, "char_end": 1018}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "所以，不要担心全靠修辞能取消事实的宣判。", "char_start": 1019, "char_end": 1039}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 29}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0229"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：欧洲难道没有一个政治家，看出来美国才是扰乱欧洲的幕后黑手？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“火候问题”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“欧洲的“政治家”，要等到民心可用的时候才会露头。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "欧洲的“政治家”，要等到民心可用的时候才会露头。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "08758bf8-f30d-5a9d-9e56-f8df4cd35d48", "source_ordinal": 2577, "reading_ordinal": 1476, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "我要", "published_at": "2022-10-03T01:21:10+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/348946957/answer/2699185231"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "唉。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 2}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你根本没有必要去询问别人这正不正常。", "char_start": 3, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "因为你其实并没有绝对必要按照别人的评价标准生活。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你觉得不能接受，就已经可以合法主张你不能接受。别人能不能接受、“大多数人”能不能接受，跟你能不能接受并没有什么必然的关系。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "对方是跟你结婚，不是跟“知乎平均人”结婚。对方有责任给你一个专属于你的答复，而不能用“别人都这样，怎么你不行”来搪塞。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 168}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "“别人都可以，怎么你不行”这种话术，在这个场景下根本不成立。", "char_start": 169, "char_end": 199}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "“别人”也许都可以，但是“别人”没跟你结婚，在跟你说话的也不是“别人”。", "char_start": 200, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "别人能接受，就意味着我“必须”接受？", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 255}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "别人收入也比你高，你为什么不更多赚点？", "char_start": 256, "char_end": 275}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "别人比你长得帅，你凭什么长得这么一般？", "char_start": 276, "char_end": 295}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "在这里提别人有什么意义？意义是我不接受，自然有人能接受，是吗？", "char_start": 296, "char_end": 327}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这当然是你的权利。", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "只不过下一个人一样会有别人能而ta不能的事——谁是“绝对平均人”？", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 371}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "难道你是要跟真空里的球形人在绝对光滑的表面上完全弹性的生活吗？", "char_start": 372, "char_end": 403}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "谈判、处事，直接谈你要什么，不要畏畏缩缩的只提“人类平均要求”。", "char_start": 404, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "世界上只有一个我，我有我的要求。", "char_start": 437, "char_end": 453}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "别人能满足，那是别人的事，不要在我面前摆出“别人能满足，你凭什么不满意”的逻辑来。", "char_start": 454, "char_end": 495}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "我不是别人。", "char_start": 496, "char_end": 502}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "我是不可替代的。", "char_start": 503, "char_end": 511}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你只能通过满足A的要求来让A满意，你不能通过满足B的要求来让A满意。", "char_start": 512, "char_end": 546}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "a顾客点了盘鱼香肉丝，你上了盘水煮鱼跟ta说隔壁八桌都点水煮鱼，吃得很开心，你还有啥不满意？", "char_start": 547, "char_end": 593}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这难道还算是一个值得讨论一番才能让你知道错在哪里的问题吗？", "char_start": 594, "char_end": 623}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "小心翼翼到处去问，问出很多桌也点的是鱼香肉丝才敢跟店家说“不好意思我点的是鱼香肉丝”，从一开始就放弃了自己主张的正当性。", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 684}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这种放弃会导致你的主张直接被无视，这无法用“这四桌点了鱼香肉丝”来补足。", "char_start": 685, "char_end": 721}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "没有合法性的主张，才需要这种次要证据来证明“不过分”。", "char_start": 722, "char_end": 749}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "寻找次要证据，实际上是在无声的主张“我知道我的诉求没有正当性”。", "char_start": 750, "char_end": 782}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0229"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：姐弟之间这样正常吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“我要”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“唉。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "唉。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 2, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "42282539-802d-594a-9855-5456434893a8", "source_ordinal": 2576, "reading_ordinal": 1477, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "改编权", "published_at": "2022-10-03T02:03:39+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/557400424/answer/2699207489"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "《三国演义》是《三国志》的改编。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "《射雕英雄传》《倚天屠龙记》《书剑恩仇录》……是宋、元、明、清史的改编。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 53}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "《西游记》是对唐玄奘天竺取经的改编。", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "《大时代》是对香港股市交易史的改编。", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "《精武门》是对霍元甲家史的改编。", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "《一代宗师》是对叶问家史的改编。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 125}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "曹操、孙权、铁木真、拖雷、木华黎、康熙、鳌拜、玄奘法师、李嘉诚、陈真、霍元甲、叶问们的名誉权要怎么办？", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "过两天俄国大力士后人跳出来——“你们胡说，我爷爷根本没有那么做”，李连杰是不是要赔ta一个亿票房？", "char_start": 180, "char_end": 229}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "取了你的材，人物塑造参考了你，并不意味着这个角色就是你，更谈不上这个角色要为你的“名誉权”负责，或者这个片子就要接受你的指导，要按你的个人喜好来办。", "char_start": 231, "char_end": 305}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "要是把这个基本规矩翻过来，那于谦他父亲王老爷子打起名誉权官司来岂不是要把德云社赔到死？", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "看了那么多年电影、小说、电视剧，这还需要人来教？", "char_start": 352, "char_end": 376}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "事不关己，就知道嘲笑别人不懂事，觉得显而易见。", "char_start": 378, "char_end": 401}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "事一“关己”，那就对不起，一概不行。", "char_start": 402, "char_end": 420}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "时间要倒流，重力要反向，一切人间法律都得为我低头。", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 446}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "像什么样子？", "char_start": 447, "char_end": 453}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0229"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：《底线》中货拉拉案与原型案例有所不同，剧方是否有权宣称此案是改编而非虚构或原创?见下文?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“改编权”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“《三国演义》是《三国志》的改编。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "《三国演义》是《三国志》的改编。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0f120545-f704-56e9-b0fb-a3b9ced1bd68", "source_ordinal": 2575, "reading_ordinal": 1478, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "果断", "published_at": "2022-10-04T00:55:46+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/49278560/answer/2700435285"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这其实是一个经由“洗礼”而获得的特性。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "什么洗礼呢？——一次因为犹豫迟疑而导致的深刻遗憾和一次因为过早下结论而导致的懊悔。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "第一轮你要经历“其实我早点做出决定，无论什么决定，就可以有足够的时间打磨而不至于像现在这样只能交付一个半成品”，", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 118}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "第二轮你要经历“我结论下得太快了，其实还应该多投入一段时间来避免方向性错误”。", "char_start": 119, "char_end": 158}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "两轮都经过了，你才会学会识别“最佳决策点”，并且真的开始明白“不到时机不下定论，下了结论不必纠结”的双重必要性。", "char_start": 159, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "然后你才会学会最初级的“果断”。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 232}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "果断并不是“立刻下结论”，果断还包括断然、明确的认知“现在还不是下结论的最好时机”。", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 276}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "是基于综合经验确认自己是在最佳时机点下了尽可能好的赌注，从而进入了一种“下好离手，愿赌服输，但凭天意”的坦然状态，使得你在那个时机点之前坚定的不做结论，而那个时机点之后坚定的不做动摇。", "char_start": 277, "char_end": 369}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "是这两个坚定，成就果断的本质。", "char_start": 370, "char_end": 385}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "而不是“下决定很快，下完就不后悔”的表象。", "char_start": 386, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这种“下决定很快，而且落子不悔”的现象并不是果断造成的，而是因为善于做决定的人自然而然的因为这个特长而获得了总管全局、负责决策的（无论是家庭的还是组织的）团队角色，以至于万事缠身，不断有最佳决策点接踵而至而导致的一种表象。", "char_start": 408, "char_end": 519}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "在外人眼里看来似乎是“事来即应，当机立断”，但事实上这些决断的端倪早已在旁观者见证到之前早得多的时候就被看见、决断已在酝酿之中了。", "char_start": 520, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "专业的决策者会在根本没有这事之前就思考好“假设遇到这种情况，最好的处置是什么”，这是一种闲来无事下意识的思维游戏，一种本能的娱乐。", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 651}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这种下意识的娱乐产生两个最重要的输出——一种观测事件是否发生的监察机制（就像杀毒软件的守护进程）和一个决策框架。", "char_start": 652, "char_end": 708}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因此，那些早已被预备好决策算法和监视进程的事件，刚一出现端倪就会被监察机制看到。只等“现实允许的最大可得情报”这一个变量补齐，决策框架就会立刻产生质量优良的结论。", "char_start": 709, "char_end": 790}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "而“现实允许的最大可得情报”，说穿了，就是等待事态进展到你能等待的最后一刻。", "char_start": 791, "char_end": 829}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这一刻之前，静如处子，稳如泰山。", "char_start": 830, "char_end": 846}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这一刻之后，积极行动，勇猛精进。", "char_start": 847, "char_end": 863}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "一刻也不多等，一刻也不少等。", "char_start": 864, "char_end": 878}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "要做到这一点，语言的精确表达——实际上是对事情的精确建模、对处理机制的精确编程——极其重要，容不得半点含糊、半点乡愿。", "char_start": 880, "char_end": 939}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "语言学实际上是一种符号数学。", "char_start": 940, "char_end": 954}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你之所以犹犹豫豫、优柔寡断，本质原因总是这两个——第一是没有经过这双重洗礼。", "char_start": 955, "char_end": 993}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "第二个就是对概念的自我表达混乱含糊，以至于你根本无从形成识别机制、构造不了监视程序，更无从构建决策框架。", "char_start": 994, "char_end": 1046}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "没有这种精准的、毫不含糊的界定能力，人就总是会被情绪控制然后再实际上胡言乱语。表面上看是在“思辨”，实际上不过是拿着自以为威力巨大的砖块石片随手乱丢发泄情绪。", "char_start": 1047, "char_end": 1126}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "与己没有任何好处，于为人处事、改善事态没有任何意义，不形成任何资产积淀。", "char_start": 1127, "char_end": 1163}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "果断是来自周密。", "char_start": 1164, "char_end": 1172}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "周密是来自精确。", "char_start": 1173, "char_end": 1181}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "精确是来自面向实践的迫切自觉。", "char_start": 1182, "char_end": 1197}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你要精确的定义“欺负”的判断要件，才能设置“有人欺负我吗“的监测程序，才能有“A类欺负如何处理，B类欺负如何处理”的预案，才会有相关的物资与智力资源的准备，才有可能及时、有效的处理。", "char_start": 1198, "char_end": 1289}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你才不会悔恨和因为害怕悔恨而犹豫。", "char_start": 1290, "char_end": 1307}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "而你一开始对“欺负”的定义就是“我觉得不爽”，那么上述得的整个处理机制会全面宕机，根本就是随手胡搞。", "char_start": 1308, "char_end": 1358}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "于是，你所谓的果断，只不过假装若无其事的掩饰罢了，毫无意义——而且无论结果如何，你都会后悔。", "char_start": 1359, "char_end": 1405}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 34}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0229"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何成为一个果断的人？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032"], "summary": "围绕“果断”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这其实是一个经由“洗礼”而获得的特性。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这其实是一个经由“洗礼”而获得的特性。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
